{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "Householder",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The\r\nproposed vehicular crossover, by reason of its proximity to &amp;nbsp;the existing mature Silver Maple Tree which would\r\nobstruct the driven visibility splay of drivers accessing the crossover, would &amp;nbsp;result in a significant risk to the safety of\r\nhighway users, and would thereby fail to comply with the policy T4 of the London Plan\r\n(2021)&amp;nbsp;and policy DM42 of&amp;nbsp;Harrow&#x27;s Development Management Policies\r\nLocal Plan (2013).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Insufficient\r\ninformation has been provided regarding the practicality of implementing the\r\nproposed mitigation measures to protect the adjacent mature Silver Maple street\r\ntree from construction and post-development impacts of the proposed crossing. As\r\na result, insufficient information has been provided to enable the Local\r\nPlanning Authority to determine whether the proposal would be likely to result\r\nin harm to the mature Silver Maple street tree, contrary to Policy G7 of The\r\nLondon Plan (2021) and Policies DM22 and DM23 of&amp;nbsp;Harrow&#x27;s Development\r\nManagement Policies Local Plan (2013).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
